      "content": "i know, i know, but i'm not looking for a lecture on healthy habits, i'm just trying to optimize what i'm already doing. i drink way more caffeine than the average person and i've never had a heart issue or anything. i just want to know the upper limit so i don't overdo it. like, if i'm taking a high dose of green tea extract, how many milligrams of caffeine is \"too much\" for someone with a high tolerance? i need a number to aim for.",
